1
00:00:00,473 --> 00:00:04,183
MRS. WOLOWITZ: You're right.
When you're right, you're right.

2
00:00:05,895 --> 00:00:09,895
-What if they're out of the Le Sueur?
-Then get the regular!

3
00:00:10,483 --> 00:00:13,023
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
All right. You don't have to yell.

4
00:00:13,194 --> 00:00:14,574
[DOOR CLOSES]

5
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:16,739
(Howard:)Sorry about that.

6
00:00:17,448 --> 00:00:18,488
[CELL PHONE CHIMING]

7
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,540
(Bernadette(her phone chimes):)-Let me just put that on vibrate.
-I'm already on vibrate.

8
00:00:22,703 --> 00:00:24,283
[MAKES VIBRATING SOUND]

9
00:00:24,831 --> 00:00:26,411
Okay, now, that one I got.

10
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:30,625
(Bernadette:)Howard, did you say something
to Leonard about me?

11
00:00:30,795 --> 00:00:31,835
(Howard:)What do you mean?

12
00:00:32,004 --> 00:00:36,054
(Bernadette:)He says if I go see his experiment
tomorrow, it might weird you out.

13
00:00:36,217 --> 00:00:37,507
(Howard:)Really? He said that?

14
00:00:37,844 --> 00:00:41,724
(Bernadette:)-You're not jealous of Leonard, are you?
-Me? No.

15
00:00:41,889 --> 00:00:45,179
(Howard:)I may have mentioned
that it's a little inappropriate...

16
00:00:45,351 --> 00:00:48,351
(Howard:)...to be asking another man's girlfriend
to his experiment...

17
00:00:48,521 --> 00:00:50,521
...without discussing it with said man.

18
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:53,480
(Bernadette:)I need to ask your permission
to hang out with Leonard?

19
00:00:53,651 --> 00:01:00,021
(Howard:)I didn't say anything like that.
I said Leonard has to ask my permission.

